From 78cd40c7a5102524536daf9a3178426777174d2d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 02:49:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(speculative): isolate AITER MTP draft KV layout and graph
 metadata

- Fix MiMo-V2.5-Pro MTP accuracy with AITER Gluon target verification by keeping target KV caches in SHUFFLE 5D while allocating draft caches in NHD.
- Propagate the correct 4/5/6-token graph metadata and acceptance state, prevent stale metadata reuse, and reject unsafe eager draft fallbacks.

Signed-off-by: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
---
 .../srt/layers/attention/aiter_backend.py     | 39 +++++++++--
 python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/memory_pool.py    | 68 ++++++++++++-------
 .../model_runner_kv_cache_mixin.py            | 34 +++++++++-
 .../srt/speculative/base_spec_worker.py       |  8 +++
 ...er_eagle_draft_extend_cuda_graph_runner.py |  2 +
 .../multi_layer_eagle_worker_v2.py            | 23 +++++--
 6 files changed, 133 insertions(+), 41 deletions(-)

